<title>USA: Maine Bond Bank restructured, maturities added.</title>
<headline>Maine Bond Bank restructured, maturities added.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it restructured Maine Municipal Bond Bank's $20.8 million bond deal, adding maturities in 2012 and 2013.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:  </p>
